  "body": "Vendor says take another look at this refurbished two-bedroom, approximately 62m² unit which blends timeless character with modern comfort and an exceptional coastal location. Held on a cross-lease title with no body corporate fees, it also offers a separate lock-up garage for added convenience and security.\r\n\r\nFreshly painted inside and out, the home has been thoughtfully refreshed complemented by a modern kitchen and bathroom with underfloor heating; while the 3 heat pumps ensure year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nTucked quietly away from the road, enjoy peace and privacy and easy access to  Kohimarama Beach. Eastridge Shopping Centre is close by for everyday convenience, with sought-after local schooling Kohimarama Primary School and Selwyn College and an easy commute to Auckland City.\r\nTime is running out to secure this - now asking $839,000. Call me today.",
